                <head>No. 6<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>During the Ninth Session of the North Atlantic Council, which met in Lisbon,
                    February 20–25, discussion was held concerning the relationship between the
                        OEEC and NATO. For documentation concerning the Session, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1952-54v05p1/pg_107">volume V, Part 1, pages 107</ref>
                    ff.</p>
            </div>
